{"corpus":"ccc","number":1265,"text_html":"<span>Le Baptême ne purifie pas seulement de tous les péchés, il fait aussi du néophyte « une création nouvelle<sup class=\"srcRef cccRef\">§505</sup> » <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"1\">1</sup>, un fils adoptif de Dieu <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"2\">2</sup> qui est devenu « participant de la nature divine » <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"3\">3</sup>, membre du Christ<sup class=\"srcRef cccRef\">§460</sup> <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"4\">4</sup> et cohéritier avec Lui <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"6\">5</sup>, temple de l’Esprit Saint <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"7\">6</sup>.</span>","cross_refs":["505","460"],"bible_refs":[{"text":"2 Co 5:17"},{"text":"Ga 4:5-7"},{"text":"Ga 2 P 1:4"},{"text":"1 Co 6:15"},{"text":"1 Co 12:27"},{"text":"Rm 8:17"},{"text":"1 Co 6:19"}],"citations":[],"magisterial_refs":[{"type":"bible","raw":"2 Co 5:17","idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Ga 4:5-7","idx":2,"display_idx":2},{"type":"bible","raw":"2 P 1:4","idx":3,"display_idx":3},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir 1 Co 6:15","idx":4,"display_idx":4},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"12:27","idx":5,"marker_idx":4,"display_idx":4},{"type":"bible","raw":"Rm 8:17","idx":6,"display_idx":5},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir 1 Co 6:19","idx":7,"display_idx":6}]}